1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,782
Every meeting starts with a voice.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,866
But life has a way of getting in.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,465
Meet Hearly. Your voice, brought into focus.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,443
Hearly learns the sound of your voice, right on your device.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,369
Then it separates you from the noise around you.

6
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:35,769
The keyboard. The café. The conversation across the room.

7
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,344
So when you speak, only your voice goes into the meeting.

8
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,916
One clear connection. From your microphone, through Hearly, to your call.

9
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,988
Hearly. Your voice. Nothing else.
